# Inside Iran: every source on our own mirrors, for a national-internet outage (ADR-0170).
# Images through registry.mytxnet.ir (it pulls Docker Hub and others itself);
# npm, go, prisma, apt, pypi and single files through Nexus.
DOCKER_REGISTRY=registry.mytxnet.ir
PKG_MIRROR=https://packages.mytxnet.ir/repository
APK_MIRROR=https://packages.mytxnet.ir/repository/alpine
